{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108400","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910840001:1":{"text":"你……是你。","source_cn":"你……是你。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xC6A55BCD67AF2F98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910840002:1":{"text":"你是那个声音。","source_cn":"你是那个声音。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x83078BE48C712BE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910840003:1":{"text":"是我，也是你。","source_cn":"是我，也是你。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xA6CDAE19E4745689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910840004:1":{"text":"我不想让你害怕，为什么不坐下来呢？我曾经许下一个承诺，...","source_cn":"我不想让你害怕，为什么不坐下来呢？我曾经许下一个承诺，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910840005:1":{"text":"坐吧，亲爱的我，面对自身，没什么好怕的。","source_cn":"坐吧，亲爱的我，面对自身，没什么好怕的。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5EF241F8016DD67B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910840006:1":{"text":"有一瞬间……我以为我就是你。我看到好多记忆，卡律先生的...","source_cn":"有一瞬间……我以为我就是你。我看到好多记忆，卡律先生的...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910840007:1":{"text":"因为我们<style=highlight2>本就是一体...","source_cn":"因为我们<style=highlight2>本就是一体...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910840008:1":{"text":"浅海裔，深海裔，无数的名字，无数的记忆，都是我。","source_cn":"浅海裔，深海裔，无数的名字，无数的记忆，都是我。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xD8B8DB960024B564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910840009:1":{"text":"你们是我散落在浅海的碎片，是神明的一部分，那些深海的孩...","source_cn":"你们是我散落在浅海的碎片，是神明的一部分，那些深海的孩...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910840010:1":{"text":"告诉我，亲爱的我，为什么只有你不愿意回来？你的家人，你...","source_cn":"告诉我，亲爱的我，为什么只有你不愿意回来？你的家人，你...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910840011:1":{"text":"因为我……不是你。我不是你，我怎么可能是你？！","source_cn":"因为我……不是你。我不是你，我怎么可能是你？！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BF54401FF022DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910840012:1":{"text":"阿嬷，沫霖姐姐，卡律先生……！他们和我一样，都是独立的...","source_cn":"阿嬷，沫霖姐姐，卡律先生……！他们和我一样，都是独立的...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910840013:1":{"text":"你在发抖，真可怜，嘘……嘘……别害怕，过来，你需要一个拥抱。","source_cn":"你在发抖，真可怜，嘘……嘘……别害怕，过来，你需要一个拥抱。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD98AC54C2E962C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910840014:1":{"text":"不许用阿嬷的方式说话！","source_cn":"不许用阿嬷的方式说话！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xE0DA928F5267B529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910840015:1":{"text":"为什么不呢？那本来就是我的语言呀，我记得在夜里为你唱童...","source_cn":"为什么不呢？那本来就是我的语言呀，我记得在夜里为你唱童...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910840016:1":{"text":"我记得卡律为了保持清醒而流血的样子，但他其实不必那么做...","source_cn":"我记得卡律为了保持清醒而流血的样子，但他其实不必那么做...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910840017:1":{"text":"你知道这一点，对不对？到了现在的时刻，我曾经历的一切，...","source_cn":"你知道这一点，对不对？到了现在的时刻，我曾经历的一切，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910840018:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910840019:1":{"text":"你知道我想以完整的身份与自己的亲人团聚——正如你现在所...","source_cn":"你知道我想以完整的身份与自己的亲人团聚——正如你现在所...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910840020:1":{"text":"艾雅，她是你的妹妹，你所剩不多的族人……","source_cn":"艾雅，她是你的妹妹，你所剩不多的族人……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x4B86E53FAA4FEE3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910840021:1":{"text":"我们背负了诅咒，我不想在堕落后伤害她，也不想让她遍体鳞...","source_cn":"我们背负了诅咒，我不想在堕落后伤害她，也不想让她遍体鳞...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910840022:1":{"text":"而你了解那种绝望和痛苦。","source_cn":"而你了解那种绝望和痛苦。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xFF7461F7B7BC9052","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910840023:1":{"text":"就像卡律先生，不得不对他的族裔举起武器……他当时很痛苦。","source_cn":"就像卡律先生，不得不对他的族裔举起武器……他当时很痛苦。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB24BE8AE6B2C32BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910840024:1":{"text":"我想与她团聚，五百年一次的机会，唯一一瞬的清醒。","source_cn":"我想与她团聚，五百年一次的机会，唯一一瞬的清醒。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xA7FDCF298CBAE1FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910840025:1":{"text":"而我们……海裔……可以幸福自在地存在五百年。五百年之后...","source_cn":"而我们……海裔……可以幸福自在地存在五百年。五百年之后...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910840026:1":{"text":"之后，新的海裔再次出生，你会沉睡在我们的身体里，直到我...","source_cn":"之后，新的海裔再次出生，你会沉睡在我们的身体里，直到我...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910840027:1":{"text":"然后，融为一体……","source_cn":"然后，融为一体……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_